00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:09.250
dropped, but it was those gauntlets he's wearing
that really got me intrigued and I know a

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.470
lot of you guys were excited about them too!

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:15.540
Yippee-ki-yay, movie lovers, it's Jan here,
and today I'm examining the clues in the Infinity

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:20.050
War trailer and the comics to reveal what
kind of shield we can expect to see Cap use

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:21.600
in Avengers: Infinity War.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.040
And I think you're gonna to be pretty psyched
about this cool upgrade!

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:29.110
Just before I get into that, if this is your
first time here, I do regular comic book movie

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:33.879
and theory videos, and today I'm kicking off
a new round of my superhero giveaway for all

00:00:33.879 --> 00:00:34.879
my subscribers.

